WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.104
Open Member or first-time visitor.

00:00:04.354 --> 00:00:07.569
Enter the person’s full name and the available contact

00:00:07.569 --> 00:00:09.713
details that are appropriate to record.

00:00:09.963 --> 00:00:11.769
Add the first-visit date if known.

00:00:12.019 --> 00:00:15.394
Tick Interested in Foundation School only if requested.

00:00:15.644 --> 00:00:18.356
Choose Save person and wait for Person recorded.

00:00:18.606 --> 00:00:21.634
This records the person; it does not automatically enrol

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:24.325
them in a class or create a follow-up.

00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:27.960
Ask the appropriate leader to arrange those next steps.
